        <activityName xml:lang="en">Steel, converter, unalloyed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Steel, converter, unalloyed, at plant
This process produces primary steel. Scrap is only used for cooling the liquid steel.;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 5a305fc4-5d14-3854-8047-b1f97d439220
Transports of hot metal and other input materials to converter, steel making process and casting.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5a305fc4-5d14-3854-8047-b1f97d439220.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
